# basedpyright Unknown Types Detection
RULE: Always use basedpyright (never pyright). Enable reportUnknown* in pyrightconfig.json. Only audited bypasses in QUALITY_GATE_BYPASS_AUDIT.md may pass.
WHY: pyright is deprecated; basedpyright aligns with Pylance and catches Unknown types that hide bugs.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/quality-gates.md, .cursor/rules/quality-gates-audit-factors.mdc
DO: Set reportUnknownVariableType, reportUnknownParameterType, reportUnknownArgumentType, reportUnknownMemberType, reportAny, reportMissingParameterType to "error" in pyrightconfig.json; use `run_timeout 120 basedpyright <source_dir>/`
NEVER: Use pyright; set reportUnknown* to "none"; relax rules without audit
